  "caveats": [
    "the percentile table of lgbm-game-v7 comes from one-seed fold models, each trained on one world fewer, while the exported part is the final model averaged over several seeds and trained on every world; its scores can run higher or lower, so the review rate on new traffic can differ from review_rate",
    "the held-out worlds also chose lgbm-game-v7's configuration and tree count, so its reference scores are slightly optimistic",
    "lgbm-game-v5's validation days chose its tree count by early stopping, and its world's reference rows come only from late days, when players have long histories"
